[
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# Zeeuws erfgoedplatform: museum objects\n\nExplores the dump of [Zeeuws erfgoedplatform - Museum objecten](https://zoeken.collectiezeeland.nl/AtlantisPubliek/data/dataset/Zeeuws+erfgoedplatform+-+Museum+objecten) (Collectie Zeeland, CC0), described in `exploration/datasets/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-object.jsonld`.\n\n**Before running:** download the dump with `pnpm --filter @verdronkendorpen/exploration run fetch:zeeuws-erfgoedplatform`. It ends up in `dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl` (about 24 MB), which every cell uses as its endpoint.\n\nThe data uses CIDOC-CRM for the objects and schema.org for images, licences and identifiers. Places are mostly free text: the only structured places are production places.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Overview\n\nWhich classes occur, and how often.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?class (COUNT(?s) AS ?count) WHERE {\n  ?s a ?class\n}\nGROUP BY ?class\nORDER BY DESC(?count)",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Objects\n\nProperties used on the museum objects (`crm:E22_Human-Made_Object`).",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?property (COUNT(*) AS ?count) WHERE {\n  ?object a crm:E22_Human-Made_Object ;\n    ?property ?value .\n}\nGROUP BY ?property\nORDER BY DESC(?count)",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "One complete object, two levels deep: the glass fragments found where the drowned Hontenisse was.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?property ?value ?property2 ?value2 WHERE {\n  BIND(<https://hdl.handle.net/21.12128/324184791> AS ?object)\n  ?object ?property ?value .\n  OPTIONAL {\n    ?value ?property2 ?value2 .\n    FILTER(isBlank(?value) || ?property2 = rdfs:label)\n  }\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Places\n\nThe only structured places are production places (`crm:P108i_was_produced_by/crm:P7_took_place_at`).",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?place (COUNT(DISTINCT ?object) AS ?objects) WHERE {\n  ?object crm:P108i_was_produced_by/crm:P7_took_place_at/rdfs:label ?place .\n}\nGROUP BY ?place\nORDER BY DESC(?objects)",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Types and materials\n\nThe most common object types (`crm:P2_has_type`) and materials (`crm:P45_consists_of`).",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?type (COUNT(DISTINCT ?object) AS ?objects) WHERE {\n  ?object a crm:E22_Human-Made_Object ;\n    crm:P2_has_type/rdfs:label ?type .\n}\nGROUP BY ?type\nORDER BY DESC(?objects)\nLIMIT 50",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?material (COUNT(DISTINCT ?object) AS ?objects) WHERE {\n  ?object a crm:E22_Human-Made_Object ;\n    crm:P45_consists_of/crm:P2_has_type/rdfs:label ?material .\n}\nGROUP BY ?material\nORDER BY DESC(?objects)\nLIMIT 50",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Dates\n\nWhen objects were made: the production period (`crm:P108i_was_produced_by/crm:P4_has_time-span`, with `crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin` and `crm:P82b_end_of_the_end`). Only about 14% of the objects have one. `0001-01-01` means unknown (in 422 end dates and in every `schema:datePublished`, which is therefore useless). Grouped by century of the begin year.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?century (COUNT(DISTINCT ?object) AS ?objects) (SUM(IF(YEAR(?end) = 1, 1, 0)) AS ?unknownEnd) WHERE {\n  ?object a crm:E22_Human-Made_Object ;\n    crm:P108i_was_produced_by/crm:P4_has_time-span ?timeSpan .\n  ?timeSpan crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin ?begin ;\n    crm:P82b_end_of_the_end ?end .\n  FILTER(YEAR(?begin) > 1)\n  BIND(FLOOR(YEAR(?begin) / 100) * 100 AS ?century)\n}\nGROUP BY ?century\nORDER BY ?century",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Images and licences\n\nHow many objects have a thumbnail and an IIIF manifest, and under which licence.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?object) AS ?objects) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withThumbnail) AS ?thumbnails) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withIiif) AS ?iiifManifests) WHERE {\n  ?object a crm:E22_Human-Made_Object .\n  OPTIONAL {\n    ?object schema:image ?thumbnail .\n    FILTER(isLiteral(?thumbnail))\n    BIND(?object AS ?withThumbnail)\n  }\n  OPTIONAL {\n    ?object schema:image/schema:contentUrl ?manifest .\n    BIND(?object AS ?withIiif)\n  }\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?license (COUNT(DISTINCT ?object) AS ?objects) WHERE {\n  ?object a crm:E22_Human-Made_Object .\n  OPTIONAL { ?object schema:license ?license }\n}\nGROUP BY ?license",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Searching for drowned villages\n\nObjects whose title mentions drowning. Script `03-zeeuws-erfgoedplatform` does the same for all village names.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?object ?title ?manifest WHERE {\n  ?object a crm:E22_Human-Made_Object ;\n    rdfs:label ?title .\n  FILTER(REGEX(?title, \"verdronk|verdwen|verzwolg\", \"i\"))\n  OPTIONAL { ?object schema:image/schema:contentUrl ?manifest }\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "Search for specific names: edit the regular expression. Names are case-sensitive here, to avoid matching ordinary words.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?object ?field ?text WHERE {\n  ?object a crm:E22_Human-Made_Object .\n  {\n    ?object rdfs:label ?text .\n    BIND(\"title\" AS ?field)\n  } UNION {\n    ?object schema:abstract ?text .\n    BIND(\"abstract\" AS ?field)\n  } UNION {\n    ?object crm:P108i_was_produced_by/crm:P7_took_place_at/rdfs:label ?text .\n    BIND(\"productionPlace\" AS ?field)\n  }\n  FILTER(REGEX(?text, \"Reimerswaal|Saeftinghe|Hontenisse|Tolseinde\"))\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Makers\n\nThe most frequent creators (`schema:creator`).",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../dumps/zeeuws-erfgoedplatform-museum-objecten.ttl]\nPREFIX crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?creator ?name (COUNT(DISTINCT ?object) AS ?objects) WHERE {\n  ?object schema:creator ?creator .\n  OPTIONAL { ?creator rdfs:label ?name }\n}\nGROUP BY ?creator ?name\nORDER BY DESC(?objects)\nLIMIT 25",
    "metadata": {}
  }
]
